---
title: "The Ideal Human Is a Practice, Not a Label"
description: "Reflections on learning, self-regulation, critical thinking, ethics and what it means to develop as a human being in a technological age."
language: en
category: "Thinking / Education"
publishedAt: 2026-10-21
